                  \\langle
                  \\Omega,E\rangle-\mathbf{Alg}
            (a
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variety+of+algebras"} variety of algebras
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+functor+theorem"} adjoint functor theorem
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra+over+a+Lawvere+theory"} here
          %h2#notation Notation
          %p
            Let us first fix some notation and recall the required facts on varieties of algebras. We assume the foundations of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Categories+Work"} Categories Work
            (ZFC plus one fixed universe). Let
