          %p It can be verified that this lemma still holds (in our context) if, in the definition of subobject and spanning arrow, ‘’monic’‘ is replaced by ‘’the underlying function is injective.’‘
          #spans.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_2 Lemma
            %p
              If a cone
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
