                    S',A'\rangle\to\langle S,A\rangle
              be the inclusion. Then we have the cone
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mover
                      %mi τ
